# Production Environment Variables
# These are used during Vercel build time
# On Vercel dashboard, set these in Environment Variables:
# - DATABASE_URL: Your production PostgreSQL URL
# - AUTH_SECRET: JWT secret (generate with: openssl rand -base64 32)
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL: https://your-domain.vercel.app

# Build-time placeholder (Vercel will override with dashboard values)
# DATABASE_URL is REQUIRED - set it in Vercel project settings
# AUTH_SECRET is REQUIRED for JWT signing
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL should be your production domain
